ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, notice that the right-hand side is negative. Therefore, the equation has no solutions.</p>\n</div></div>",
